Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Institutional DeFi desks hit EVM block gas\Nlimits under cold-storage clearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Multilateral debt netting & batch auctions\Nquickly saturate standard EVM execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,StylusClear v1.1.0 solves this in no_std\NRust compiled for Arbitrum Stylus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero-patch WASM 1.0 MVP: 24,484 B Brotli-q11\N(88 B below 24 KiB legacy & 96 KB ArbOS 61 caps).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero floating-point or post-MVP opcodes,\Nverified via Binaryen wasm-opt --mvp-features.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Scenario 1 clears a 4-desk institutional ring:\N$13,200 gross compressed to $1,050 residual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,92.05% settlement liquidity saved across 2\Nmultilateral cycles + 2.00 WETH @ $2,850.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Scaling the canonical 2-Origin BFS mesh to\N24 and 64 desks runs in under 5 milliseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Scenario 2 triggers our fail-closed oracle\Nband guard: LimitPriceViolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire batch rolls back atomically with\N0.00% compression and zero partial state.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Scenario 4: Robinhood Chain Testnet (46630)\Nclearing USDG + tokenized equity NVDAx.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,$24,000 gross obligations compressed to\N$1,400 residual — 94.17% liquidity saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Adaptive floor-capped liquidation protects\Nborrowers and guarantees vault solvency.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dual-chain ready: Arbitrum Sepolia (421614)\Nand Robinhood Chain Testnet (46630).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Payable StylusAtomicFactory binds CREATE2\Nsalt to caller + admin under strict CEI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Detects 0xEFF000 Stylus bytecode, activates\Nvia ArbWasm (0x71), and initializes atomically.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Strict ERC-20 balance-delta checks guard\Nevery deposit, withdraw, and fee sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Identical read-only reentrancy guards across\Nall 37 ABI methods and 19 custom errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keyless eth_call dual-VM parity verification\Nworks directly from workbench or CLI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Run one-click dual-chain deploy to populate\Nlive receipts on Arbiscan & Robinhood Explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Strictly isomorphic benchmarks: 2, 9, 33, 45\Neliminated cycles on both Foundry & Rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress tier drops from 18.30M cold EVM gas\Nto 2.26M Stylus est.: -87.7% (8.11x savings).
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Comfortably below Arbitrum's 32M single-block\Ngas cap under EIP-2929 vm.cool() cold slots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,6/6 Z3 SMT theorems PROVED_UNSAT + 100/100\NHypothesis fuzz runs cross-checked vs Rust CLI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,17/17 Foundry, 8/8 Cargo (0 clippy), 8/8\NPytest, and 37-method Seam S3 gates passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,StylusClear v1.1.0 — 5-stage verification\Nin under 20 seconds via verify-judge-60s.sh.
